    "detailed_description": "A young man in high school tragically dies.<br />\r\nAnd even more tragically, goes to Hell<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut turns out Hell is not fire and brimstone.<br />\r\nHell is a corporate office building.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd the reason the main character is in Hell is because an intern screwed up his paperwork SO badly that now his only way out of Hell...is to do her job for her!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player must act as the devil on the shoulders of 5 different people on Earth who are scheduled to die that day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay through 5 different stories and make bad decisions to ensure that each human dies on schedule, before upper management gets wind of the mistake.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the player completes all 5 missions, the infernal intern (Yoshina) will return the otherwise damned player get back to his body.<br />\r\nFail, and they will stay trapped in an endless realm of infinite toured that is a corporation.I mean, Hell.<br />\r\nAnd there's no unpaid overtime.<br />\r\nNow get to work!",
